      "reason": "The draft def-time-orientation-and-future-causal-sets claims topology is basis-independent, but its cited cone lemma proves this only for orthonormal bases; this definition relies on the resulting component claims, so supply the general finite-dimensional basis-change argument locally."
    },
    {
